# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This lesson on Sample-based Krylov quantum diagonalization (SKQD) combines "
"methods explained in previous methods. It consists of a single example "
"leveraging the Qiskit patterns framework:\n"
